# The couriers service's api: the one leaf its process implements.
#
# A signature plus a hint in `{…}`: the design says what the call takes and answers, and
# the implementation is the host's — the couriers process alone
# (`demo/distributed/delivery/couriers.py`). `estimate.viba` imports this file and calls
# this one name.

days_for =
    int
  <- $env Env
  <- $x int
  <- { how many days a parcel of this weight takes, and record the answer }
